Subject: [PATCH] Stable USB device names and one-command robot launch

- bringup package: robot.launch.py starts roomba, lidar, vision and web
- bringup/udev_setup: guided tool that creates /dev/neuravac_{roomba,lidar,camera}
- roomba/lidar/vision YAML and defaults use the stable names; lidar and
  vision configs are now installed
- vision: camera_device parameter, re-resolved on camera recovery
- web: can show frames from the vision topic so only one process owns the webcam
